      "content": "Please do not adjust your insulin dosage without consulting your doctor or a certified diabetes educator. Rapid fluctuations in blood sugar can be dangerous, and taking too much insulin could lead to hypoglycemia. Use your continuous glucose monitor (CGM) or fingerstick testing to get an accurate reading and follow your personalized diabetes management plan. If you are concerned about your symptoms, please contact your healthcare provider immediately for guidance.",
